    <artifactId>killbill-platform-plugin-runtime</artifactId>
    <packaging>jar</packaging>
    <name>killbill-platform-plugin-runtime</name>
    <description>Hosts LPR inside Kill Bill: assembles the runtime, hangs it off the existing
        lifecycle phases, and mirrors plugin service registrations into the per-type registries the
        business modules inject.

        This is the adapter layer. LPR stays a general-purpose plugin runtime that knows nothing
        about payments or invoices; everything Kill Bill-specific lives here.

        Replaces killbill-platform-osgi.</description>

